    {
      "key": "006ab27",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "De hiányzik 7 fotó hidakról és hajókról a Szajnán!",
      "sourceEnText": "But I miss 7 photos about bridges and boats on the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_006ab27.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3318,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:02Z",
      "textHash": "6ba364d0829c34e2704f94cd93f67ee1e5d07b1e55cdd7c5d92c4eb35e1b2194"
    },
    {
      "key": "00728bb",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "Egy lakóhajó is lehet otthon.",
      "sourceEnText": "A houseboat can be a home.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_00728bb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1829,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:59Z",
      "textHash": "efa75d3d0113696ae40c40b720abacf603d6b5ea7564822992d1ecbcc49bb974"
    },
    {
      "key": "0129c99",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Ennek a hajónak nagy ablakai vannak. A turisták megcsodálhatják a várost. Ez egy \"folyami hajó\".",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat has large windows. Tourists can admire the city. It's a \"riverboat\".",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0129c99.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6426,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:49Z",
      "textHash": "764117d923e99af8837f176dc4aafb6d1da1b6015e662569881c8b7541987bf9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0165157",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Miért hívják ezt a hajót lakóhajónak?",
      "sourceEnText": "Why is this boat called a houseboat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0165157.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2351,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:43Z",
      "textHash": "623c619be211c8ef07f191494241f1f5cf63cf5d9f1eaf0901a3f0cdc00c6d6c"
    },
    {
      "key": "01663fa",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "Imádnék vonatozni!",
      "sourceEnText": "I would love to ride a train!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01663fa.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:16Z",
      "textHash": "84431b08dbc5afbb5c0e2bb090fed8dd7f7e6bd8920db419cfcbabb114513a9d"
    },
    {
      "key": "018a0eb",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Nagyon erős",
      "sourceEnText": "Very strong",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_018a0eb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 862,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:12Z",
      "textHash": "64c376a5dfef76b8447aff3c6a4b2e6c2b1f1b8b6eb3886e201d98d03353b8f6"
    },
    {
      "key": "01f30c4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Az autók gyorsan mennek. Hogyan kelhetek át biztonságosan?",
      "sourceEnText": "The cars are driving fast. How can I cross safely?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01f30c4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3318,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:04Z",
      "textHash": "c413617f67ecea5c9b60c3a334c85e3bc44b40881c71612a537cb66ca2500af1"
    },
    {
      "key": "0210ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Párizsban vagyok. Turista vagyok. Antura, a kutya elvette a könyvemet Párizsról!",
      "sourceEnText": "I'm visiting Paris. I'm a tourist. Antura the dog took my book about Paris!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0210ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:09Z",
      "textHash": "ebddc0241c6740a38463831f4c03d81d9b23813f82ce3a0ca00e2edbcd576f5a"
    },
    {
      "key": "021f382",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Miért híres ez a híd?",
      "sourceEnText": "What is special about this famous bridge?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_021f382.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:57Z",
      "textHash": "3861fbdd2c9bb6983483bacc8182d62c85ffe3cdb18ee3e981aa7e062d4266e0"
    },
    {
      "key": "02349a3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Autók szállítására",
      "sourceEnText": "To transport cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02349a3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:53Z",
      "textHash": "a583d278dc24b3a08dfae9f09fec9c3576844b958d56a2f3de366b048ab4088f"
    },
    {
      "key": "0280e8f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Ma felfedezheted a Szajnát és számos hidját. A Szajnán mindenféle hajó található.",
      "sourceEnText": "Today, you will discover the Seine and its many bridges. On the Seine, there are all kinds of boats.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0280e8f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5042,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:55:48Z",
      "textHash": "17acc6ad7219e746e5899bfeebf5282c7bf0c0aa13516e80bcb0b634662c33f2"
    },
    {
      "key": "0281b33",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "A Szajna északi irányban ömlik a La Manche csatornába (egy tengerbe).",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel (a sea) in a northerly direction.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0281b33.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4650,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:27Z",
      "textHash": "9a14544731d578c545ed16ae8edc1e1bace0158d3d627d0c62d9331abacb8d0a"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ab1e0",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "A Földközi-tenger",
      "sourceEnText": "The Mediterranean Sea",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ab1e0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:17Z",
      "textHash": "8995440972bbd55e4d9cb9c9985470910e122b095c6919360d3820111ca48b18"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ce3de",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Miért van nagy ablaka egy turistahajónak?",
      "sourceEnText": "Why does a tourist boat have big windows?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ce3de.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:50Z",
      "textHash": "ba58858f049c057f1b5b8dc2c6296666a25ff9c2d5bb49edf06294753230d456"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ed36d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Láttam egy kutyát sétálni, igen.",
      "sourceEnText": "I did see a dog walking around, yes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ed36d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:31Z",
      "textHash": "dce5fb3341d7b62c2c7f4305d834ec114985fa064144625c84bae3651bb581c8"
    },
    {
      "key": "036ba15",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Ez a hajó árut szállít",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is transporting goods",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_036ba15.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:47Z",
      "textHash": "83f96713e05769ca1ca6581b4b8c979eac195e320d90038ce761cd543084f44d"
    },
    {
      "key": "037efcf",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Víz alá menni",
      "sourceEnText": "To go under the water",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_037efcf.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:54Z",
      "textHash": "507967d579ec58fe2bc342d3fe0fdfd0cb08caf2ea5160924fb97cc0b000b318"
    },
    {
      "key": "038b8f6",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "Rengeteg híd van Párizsban!",
      "sourceEnText": "There are many bridges in Paris!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_038b8f6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:41Z",
      "textHash": "6502e8a42617e090e7951ed0f1c0f890b6d8984d11cce8b6bd52d52fb9f2c892"
    },
    {
      "key": "0395113",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "A Szajna nagyon hosszú!",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine is very long!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0395113.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:46Z",
      "textHash": "4fee590f530debc65dffad9a6e875dcb6e455d0c4089d1fd11cf4733fde283f3"
    },
    {
      "key": "03c92db",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "A La Manche csatorna",
      "sourceEnText": "The English Channel",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03c92db.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:20Z",
      "textHash": "a3c82408274ceec05941bd2adee2c3e72b505f65da48627f1d6e98c962cbeb9c"
    },
    {
      "key": "03e5667",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_ile_de_france",
      "sourceText": "Van egy Île de la Cité nevű sziget.",
      "sourceEnText": "There is an island called Île de la Cité.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03e5667.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:34Z",
      "textHash": "90c1f8286be4ee340084b3f4de5d9705ca11bbc51ad73b31f9f11856f011c5ce"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ea48b",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Jól csinálod!",
      "sourceEnText": "You are doing well!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03ea48b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1097,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:06Z",
      "textHash": "b8d19d421365ad9339d65c7d005dd7f598333cef9de566236034309afc6f45a5"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ff912",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Csak gyalogláshoz",
      "sourceEnText": "Only for walking",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03ff912.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:15Z",
      "textHash": "f6c53be1e77149a6c721d50adb6781a8d01a4a155326127365bb0edcba7b5030"
    },
    {
      "key": "04059bd",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Mit találhatsz egy teherhajón?",
      "sourceEnText": "What can you find on a goods boat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_04059bd.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:25Z",
      "textHash": "1f89670aea3fef4d4bb2c2d9abb925f74d51f1c4a2e64dbe9f887bdad22ce76d"
    },
    {
      "key": "042160f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Üdvözöljük Párizsban! Párizs Franciaország fővárosa. Párizsban van egy nagyon híres folyó. Ezt a folyót Szajnának hívják.",
      "sourceEnText": "Welcome to Paris! Paris is the capital of France. In Paris, there is a very famous river. This river is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_042160f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8229,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:55:46Z",
      "textHash": "465279c35397c459bc439000747457448b95a0bae5e3540be187529ca9ebf184"
    },
    {
      "key": "0454688",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Látni a várost és a híres helyeket",
      "sourceEnText": "To see the city and famous places",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0454688.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:52Z",
      "textHash": "7b02594846c0faf0bcdd94476272e7ddbfb0d42b64b0c61fc58e1d4341cac0e8"
    },
    {
      "key": "047502b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "A turistahajóknak nagy ablakaik vannak.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourist boats have large windows.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_047502b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:56Z",
      "textHash": "f1f72a0dd07df8e9bb2d80f6ee5af43cf6b1db5c61303144dc13b11db63733ef"
    },
    {
      "key": "0484ee9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "Az olyan hidat, amelyen csak emberek járhatnak, hidaknak nevezik...",
      "sourceEnText": "A bridge only for people to walk on is called a...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0484ee9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3866,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:20Z",
      "textHash": "614723bf71b48c3513f705ce8e56ab1f8c3fe7b25382cd9ec23d771a01bb8833"
    },
    {
      "key": "0494564",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Nagyon szeretek a Szajna mentén biciklizni!",
      "sourceEnText": "I really enjoy cycling along the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0494564.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:43Z",
      "textHash": "6a44ee5dabd4bc0b185abc63ca369dc3c23bdc17cc5b3368d69f9837d0a1430f"
    },
    {
      "key": "04b2cf2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_ile_de_france",
      "sourceText": "Párizs régi központjában található.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is in the old center of Paris.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_04b2cf2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2351,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:35Z",
      "textHash": "1eddb2cba8f6195d1466658d00af836dde9bac3072acc155ba185289b65dbeba"
    },
    {
      "key": "052fdac",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Az Atlanti-óceán",
      "sourceEnText": "The Atlantic Ocean",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_052fdac.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:23Z",
      "textHash": "217a08a23b7cd9508cf763706b5645d2910cbcd57ece4506f4b480d58e64fbed"
    },
    {
      "key": "055d822",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Ez egy híd a vonatok számára.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_055d822.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:46Z",
      "textHash": "8d7fd949f03f856da2dac51415e353038d65ae7914450cb8b1afa94946ddbbdb"
    },
    {
      "key": "056c933",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Aranyból készült szobrok vannak.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are statues made of gold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_056c933.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:56:58Z",
      "textHash": "e952b20443ec3f490a5b2f67d22dbb63e4af032303513b3318f24b7c6749f1de"
    },
    {
      "key": "0574872",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "Imádom a vonatokat!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0574872.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1358,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:17Z",
      "textHash": "d75ab0ff91a057f0c6ba362d2e84a305fc77c4f88e0298be7d0773645cc648f2"
    },
    {
      "key": "059f66d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_eiffel",
      "sourceText": "Nézd, milyen szép!",
      "sourceEnText": "Look how pretty it is!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_059f66d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1176,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:57:32Z",
